Package: RiGHoR
Title: A Robust Statistical Framework for Detecting Celltype-specific gene expression alteration in Multi-sample Single-cell Studies
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Suvo", "Chatterjee", , "suvchat@iu.edu", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Siddhant", "Meshram", , "sidmeshr@iu.edu", role = c("aut")))
Description: RiGHoR is a semiparametric rank-regression framework for robust celltype-specific differential expression analysis in multi-sample single-cell and single-nucleus RNA-sequencing data.
Imports: data.table, foreach, doParallel, readr, dplyr, peakRAM, Rfit, tidyr, pbapply
